Odoo does not offer Is a Company. If the file has a row named <strong>is_company</strong>, set it to <strong>Do not import</strong>. Odoo marks the contact as a company when <strong>vat</strong> has a tax number. Set <strong>vat</strong> to <strong>Tax ID</strong>. On the row <strong>id</strong> (the value starts with partner_), choose <strong>External ID</strong>. On the row <strong>company_id</strong>, choose <strong>Company</strong>. A customer in both companies has a blank Company, so Blueoco and Geckobrands can both use that contact. A customer in only one company says <strong>Blueoco, LLC</strong> or <strong>Geckobrands, LLC</strong>. On the row <strong>x_gp_customer_number</strong>, choose <strong>Customer Number</strong>. Do not send the customer number to Reference. On the row <strong>x_gp_customer_class</strong>, choose <strong>Customer Class</strong>. On the row <strong>x_gp_shipping_method</strong>, choose <strong>Shipping Method</strong>. Those two lists are the distinct values from Great Plains.
